200	/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------- *
201	 * Provisioner hardening (config generators for NEW accounts)
202	 *
203	 * These are the security-critical config the provisioner writes onto a
204	 * MULTI-TENANT box. They are pure + unit-tested here because a subtle gap in
205	 * any of them (a missing dangerous PHP function, a world-readable webroot, an
206	 * un-escaped GRANT wildcard) is not one customer's bug — it is a cross-tenant
207	 * breach. worker/hosting.ts imports these; it never re-derives them inline.
208	 * ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
